      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "adaptor layer\n\nconcrete implemetation of the ports and transports that talk to the\noutside world. They receive resources and translate framework/database\ntypes into application types\n\nExamples:\n- Postgres \n  persistence\n- Argon2 hashing\n- Axum HTTP\n  handlers",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "F6dMIDKjrRinFDhmtU3MO",
      "originalText": "adaptor layer\n\nconcrete implemetation of the ports and transports that talk to the outside world. They receive resources and translate framework/database types into application types\n\nExamples:\n- Postgres \n  persistence\n- Argon2 hashing\n- Axum HTTP\n  handlers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
