      "text": "domain layer\n\ndefine pure business core:\nentities, value objects, and\ninvariants that would still\nbe true without a database,\nweb server, or framework.\nNo IO, no async, on\nexternal crates",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "tzxSKYR3x_zdjGHX2iBCy",
      "originalText": "domain layer\n\ndefine pure business core: entities, value objects, and invariants that would still be true without a database, web server, or framework. No IO, no async, on external crates",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
